{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "f05b1956c7c08ba5730cd7e8146680cf26b5ba1adb1888c25b35f2bf4312eee6", "ja": "イッツショウタイム！", "zh": "表演时间到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1e0d3f60030442a3882d268f7d95d67469bc2d54117cbd003d1af17be9135c3f", "ja": "未来たちが引き起こすハプニングによって、\n現場はいつも笑顔に包まれていた。そんな撮\n影もいよいよクライマックスを迎える。最高\nの作品を作り上げるため、アイドルたちは\n最後まで懸命に演じる。", "zh": "由于未来她们引发的种种意外，  \n现场总是被笑容包围。这样的拍摄也终于迎来了高潮。  \n为了创作出最棒的作品，偶像们  \n直到最后都拼尽全力地演绎着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a8148407bad1dc60d0f172ca1c73c1ac78b8f81c38ff435f234dfd166c0678a", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、終盤の対決シーンだ。\n百合子の被害者役も、見どころだな）", "zh": "（今天拍摄的是后半段的对决场景。百合子饰演的受害者角色也很值得一看呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "122908c43855be4076d5f73b89aa596f79592db1925ac1f63d3b02e24e9d37d8", "ja": "はっ！\nき、貴島さん……。", "zh": "哈！\n贵、贵岛先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "7b97c00e070e705a8f5bbe29c70fc005d7d93ab05f0e07e030557a332bf33ffd", "ja": "こんなところで何をしているのかしら、\n甘田（かんだ）さん。患者さんは立入禁止ですよ。", "zh": "您怎么会在这种地方，甘田？患者禁止入内哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "6397b9c728df055b6340ea1c6de4e726c4ad1e911cef76dee1b5a9d5e243e2e7", "ja": "ちょっと探し物を……。", "zh": "我只是来找点东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "3d7c1056f7543360225fd056c67b59b140fa2fcee16d6f27951041d8b8c61608", "ja": "ダメですよ、勝手に入っちゃ。\n危険な薬品がたくさんあるのよ。", "zh": "不行哦，不能擅自进去。\n里面有很多危险的药品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "edc1d3e56b12bfa2ef0ab6c975b069459e083a5a3de0feea68ed123dec79ef33", "ja": "すみません。すぐ病室に戻ります。", "zh": "对不起。我马上回病房。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "1151c24d3f740f80e358426851f95e2518657ace2e19518be97aeddc55e25907", "ja": "一応、何を探しているのか教えてくれませんか？\n必要なら、私も一緒に探してあげる……。", "zh": "可以先告诉我，你在找什么吗？\n如果需要的话，我也可以陪你一起找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "33fdc19db9c1a50461f0c9109ca8c305fa2076bd6b4e0cffe462e728c9e3a153", "ja": "いえ、いいんです！\nきっと私の勘違いだから。", "zh": "不，没关系！\n一定是我误会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "3edd3b2201cbfc5b72469815aff574212554856cdf48332b4bf19f35d3ae3e26", "ja": "ふーん。\nねえ……あなた、気づいているんでしょ。", "zh": "哦——\n我说……你已经注意到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb37b72105032d438ad622b35eb8f9843f66a49850d8da962b067ae0aff72bf3", "ja": "な、なんのことですか？", "zh": "什、什么事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "2e4a561157e59a786b303eb11181d8da44685419760f531cbad1bbc0713f7272", "ja": "とぼけないで！\n……私が、犯人だっていうことよ！", "zh": "别装傻！\n……就是说，我是犯人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "33cd3b5ac08c6249c012dd766581f4a08ed915e1574e457e45f628ea68adbae2", "ja": "きゃああああっ！？\nだ、誰か、助けて～！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！？  \n谁、谁来救救我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "8bd173e494688a39924fdfa3ee237d634347e5cdbe49fda12522ce6cdabb522c", "ja": "そこまでです！！！\n……あれっ！？　誰もいない？", "zh": "到此为止！！！\n……咦！？怎么一个人都没有？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "af9bc155912cf038be8e65cede556b99e2ea4e4ea9bfa9750521a7f62d421467", "ja": "えっ？　み、みら……じゃなかった、\n刑部さん！？　どうしてここに！？", "zh": "诶？未、未……不对，是刑部小姐！？怎么会在这里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "6566ae66968b263793c912dfe6282e3278911a003181f68264d365f5455e5a09", "ja": "あっ、こっちだった！\nごめんなさーい！", "zh": "啊，原来是在这边！\n对不起啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c8d8b812d66c89d81c7c6503f008a1321ef9798bfdf73e5bb768f8e86753cfd", "ja": "でへへ……とにかく、間に合ってよかったです！", "zh": "嘿嘿……总之，能赶上真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e1a8834476637b8835ce7150233ccb481381ff99d7ba9004f2b20ab4f3363b8", "ja": "もうじき、警察がやってきます。\n無駄な抵抗はやめて、観念しなさーい！", "zh": "警察马上就到了。\n放弃无谓的抵抗，束手就擒吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1017_kantoku", "source_sha256": "8bdd60e227fc2763419d3b9dcd4a3a711b3c57a4f1c9fa60d655cae664198602", "ja": "カーーーット！", "zh": "卡——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2f4811cf25fea2e27e57830a45dca96a6130d517c3a2c1b07b437654f2c28c32", "ja": "百合子……被害者としての見せ場だし、気持ちは\nわかるけど、あれはちょっとはりきりすぎだ。", "zh": "百合子……作为受害者的高光戏份，我能理解你的心情，不过刚才是不是有点太卖力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "82050090ea37590c2ca60868a9798c43b4fb167993b277e808cada6aca1db698", "ja": "す、すみません……つい、楽しくなってしまって……。", "zh": "对、对不起……一不小心就玩得太开心了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "ebb826d6bc8927a00d304beb922bc3069cfcfb5f1c7f138c1745c76460a450a2", "ja": "大丈夫だよ百合子！\nなんか面白かったし！", "zh": "没关系的啦，百合子！\n而且感觉挺有意思的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0363965ea1ea514b75249929357f2d257cdd651ff1ea101dc3ecbb47776fe171", "ja": "未来もだぞ。\n立ち位置を間違えたら、全部やり直しだからな？", "zh": "未来也一样啊。\n要是站位弄错了，就得全部重来，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "00d1c808f581e4815ea32abfd5a112336ccba3c98f84ea85527df4a1998c934c", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい！\n反省してます……。", "zh": "对、对不起！我正在反省……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "59c935b53dbef88f5030713775f9dda7bc0bdb36834bbb3c649af324c06ed5c6", "ja": "ふ……ふふっ。", "zh": "呵……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "86a690795e1ffee4162c7bb281e6ea49c6a92bde294afa53223cfab851fed3ed", "ja": "琴葉さん……？", "zh": "琴叶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "46a3e87cae49e2422893f370770e93f05cafdd15d43232002219afe2c5d28186", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん……？", "zh": "琴叶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "54c372c1cb234aca0e09439552c92103cceb544c9eee8f77d201d4925eeb780c", "ja": "ごめんなさい。私たち、みんな一生懸命なのに、\n失敗してて……なんだかおかしいなって。", "zh": "对不起。明明我们每个人都很努力，却还是失败了……总觉得有点奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "071d1c73c5182d73a9457384b100d3adaad66e39fcf432437a2dbb7e6826deee", "ja": "言われてみれば……なんだか、\n今回の映画の登場人物みたいですね？", "zh": "这么一说……好像确实很像这次电影里的角色呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6d37b7aa53d40f205f6f6c00733251c168ac4a45bed6b84b94bd07e45a0b83d3", "ja": "そうだな。誰かがハプニングを起こす度、\n笑いをこらえるのが大変だよ。", "zh": "是啊。每当有人引发意外状况，\n我都得费好大劲才能忍住不笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "980bef127dec20d6344a168705b316bf6f3af6f613fda5c74e5f6f4c13eea0dd", "ja": "それを最終的に作品として成立させられるかどうかは、\nみんなに掛かってるけどな！", "zh": "不过，最后能不能把它做成一部完整的作品，就要看大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "17ad4413f43a999bce4db1128b1ec417fb41c76e794eceb3dfa8e939818820de", "ja": "そっかぁ……\nもしかして、漫才のレッスンしたおかげかな？", "zh": "这样啊……\n难道是因为练习漫才，才有这样的效果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "e59c726573f86547e0ecf292839764bdf072c9f0e812c0e94fb10e8193e6fe54", "ja": "ふふ、そうだね。\n意外と、ムダにはなってないのかも。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n说不定，意外地也没有白练呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "83f10222060cfcc4887ec81bf5ac73b28162ae18dbc796b23c1b8f7bb55f936d", "ja": "なら、またやってみない！？\n次は百合子も一緒に！", "zh": "那就再试一次吧！？\n下次也叫上百合子一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0c2bbed14b2689fa37e6991982eaa5b5d0df8d33a43f009a6841e20d8971822", "ja": "ええっ！？\nわ、私は、遠慮しておこうかな……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n我、我还是算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "28f92c2c906ca0a80235dbaeae6ee12dc5cbf1572c04ca9b1585f2358dc467e2", "ja": "ふたりがやりたいっていうなら、止めないけど……。\n程々にな？", "zh": "如果你们两个想做的话，我不会阻止……但要适可而止啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "daa384cca66971e0249a87ab038a040c4aaec4a362ee08d356af4e06ef1ecc74", "ja": "（上手く気持ちを切り替えられたのか、\nその後の撮影では、全員OKテイクが撮れた）", "zh": "（也许是顺利调整好了心情，之后的拍摄中，终于拍出了全员通过的镜头。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "730b0659135c290dbade7288bf05c7b35726e53a877588598e03c2ed5f256efc", "ja": "（失敗も糧に変えて、アイドル達は進んでいく。\n全員で、最高の作品を作り上げるために！）", "zh": "（把失败也化作养分，偶像们不断前进。\n为了大家一起创作出最棒的作品！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
